# A developer's own machine: a real server, a real login, a real password. It used to be tracked
# and was safe only because it used Trusted_Connection and named no password — the moment anyone
# pointed it at a SQL login, the password would have been committed. Copy the .example beside it
# and fill it in; that one is tracked and holds placeholders.
appsettings.Development.json

